LanShare MVP is an independent Android LAN file-transfer implementation.
It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by LocalSend.

This project references the publicly documented LocalSend discovery and
file-transfer ideas for interoperability-oriented study. No LocalSend
application source code, binary, asset, or copied documentation text is
included in this repository.

Referenced projects:
- LocalSend application: https://github.com/localsend/localsend
  The repository currently identifies its source as Apache-2.0 licensed.
- LocalSend Protocol documentation: https://github.com/localsend/protocol
  This repository links to the documentation as a protocol reference only;
  it does not redistribute that repository's text or code.

